===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*hirvi}} (compare {{cog|et|hirv}}, {{cog|vep|hirb'}}), borrowed from {{der|fi|bat-pro|*sirˀwis}} (compare {{cog|prg|sirwis||deer}}, {{cog|ine-bsl-pro|*śírˀnāˀ||roe deer}}), from {{cog|ine-pro|*ḱerh₂-||head, top, horn}} (compare {{cog|la|cervus}}).<ref>{{R:fi:EVE|hirvi|accessdate=2024-01-01}}</ref> {{doublet|fi|sarvi}}.

